Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.23,0:00:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit late to ask now, but how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.82,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's almost more than I can handle.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.68,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With this I feel like I could pull off ten, or even twenty projections at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad it worked.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.47,0:00:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now's our chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.95,0:00:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.49,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou and I will sneak into Ryuudou Temple from the rear,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we'll give you the signal, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.65,0:00:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see it, storm the temple through the front entrance
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.47,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and draw his attention to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're doing that,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.63,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll find Shinji and the Holy Grail and shut it down.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.30,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that's done, all that'll be left is for you to destroy the Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, about that...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something I must tell you first.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.97,0:01:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.33,0:01:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will only be able to use my holy sword once.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.56,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She has too little mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.32,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The instant she uses her sword, she'll vanish from this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.87,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supplying mana to two people.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.36,0:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on... You expect Saber to keep him busy without using her strongest attack?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.88,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other choice.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.46,0:01:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to be sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber is my Servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd let her die for no reason?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,600,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.66,Default,,0,600,0,,The mana is taking physical form.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The air... It feels just like it did ten years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.86,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that is the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The vessel must have been too small.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Grail's contents are trying to burst the vessel and leak out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.16,0:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Burst the vessel?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.05,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.42,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He ought to be somewhere in there, linked to it as its core.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be him up there?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something that looks like a person at the top.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it seems the Holy Grail is using a human body to power itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.58,0:04:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But if this continues, the vessel's incompatibility will cause it to break apart completely.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.18,0:04:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, there won't be a Holy Grail anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.71,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll just be that dangerous muck \Noozing out of the hole opened by the Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.13,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have to pull Shinji out of there fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.79,0:04:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just walking up to it unprepared?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.18,0:04:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That muck is pure curses given physical form!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't know if we don't try!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.02,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Given who Saber's up against,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.04,0:04:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't have time for indecision.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise this is.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.45,0:04:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To think your misshapen faces would sully my vision a third time,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,mongrels.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilgamesh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.70,0:04:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! If you're here, then who is Saber fighting?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I am glad that you arrived in time, Saber.{who are you again}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassin?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.45,0:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With Caster gone,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you should not have remained in this world!{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but I am a unique case, you see.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.59,0:05:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a false Servant, summoned with this location as my anchor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.09,0:05:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus I am a gatekeeper that may only appear at this main gate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.46,0:05:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,with that vixen gone,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I shan't survive the night.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.14,0:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That I have managed to last this long is simply good fortune.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that both you and Saber
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,have been forsaken by fate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.80,0:05:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you unaware that a Servant who yet \Nlingers in this world is still at the main gate?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.01,0:06:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassin...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.27,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... He's still here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.59,0:06:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then. Simply killing you would be dull.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.04,0:06:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So I shall grant you a brief reprieve.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A reprieve?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.18,0:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I would feel sorry for Shinji if none but I were there at the conclusion.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.88,0:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bearing witness to how this ends will give even your lives meaning.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.91,0:06:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously planning to commit genocide against the human race?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.69,0:06:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think merely putting your life on the line \Nentitles you to question me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.33,0:06:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This world has become far too kind to humans.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.88,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And therein lies your answer, little girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.01,0:06:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This era, in which the rabble have bred to excess,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.80,0:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,has grown far too unsightly.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.69,0:06:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past—in my world—none were extraneous.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if one were a slave, one had purpose.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.49,0:07:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who one was, one's life had significance.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.71,0:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But what of this era?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There exists more people than there is purpose and significance.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.78,0:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you yourselves also believe that you have allowed your numbers to grow too great.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.19,0:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I propose to personally cull the herd of mongrels.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.09,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The attempt ten years ago took fewer than five hundred.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.97,0:07:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, disaster will rain down upon the entire world.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the extraneous rabble have been weeded out,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall find out how many people of value remain.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the thought not excite you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.20,0:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a sicko like you would find that exciting!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.84,0:07:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool to expect a straight answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.95,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to your Holy Grail right now!{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.88,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pull Shinji out.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever else he is, he's still Sakura's brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.49,0:08:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.20,0:08:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't it your rule to save anyone as long as it's possible?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to simply walk through those curses?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.78,0:08:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think a lowly human could wade through that morass?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.97,0:08:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle curses like these as if they were nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.05,0:08:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do or die, eh? How very charming.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who gave you permission to leave my presence?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka! See to Shinji!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off Tohsaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.83,0:08:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.42,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This was to be a bit of sport before I greeted Saber,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's proven most tedious.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy sham.{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.62,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn firsthand the difference between counterfeits and the real thing!{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand aside, Assassin.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you have no further reason to guard this gate.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason, you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.60,0:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In fairness, I have never had a reason to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.89,0:09:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For I have neither the pride of a Heroic Spirit \Nnor any wish to be granted.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.50,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I am not even Sasaki Kojirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not be so astonished.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.90,0:09:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point, a man named Sasaki Kojirou likely existed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.64,0:09:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There was likely also a warrior who wielded a longsword named Monohoshizao.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.70,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,However, those two are not the same individual.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.78,0:09:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sasaki Kojirou celebrated as the foil to a renowned swordsman
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.68,0:09:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is but a fictional entity who never existed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.00,0:10:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A fictional Heroic Spirit...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.00,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. "Sasaki Kojirou" is a mantle.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.77,0:10:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was merely the swordsman deemed most suitable to wear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no name.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a ghost,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.96,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,summoned solely for my ability to perform the techniques that Sasaki Kojirou is said to have mastered.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus there was never any meaning to be found.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.62,0:10:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I am empty, so all things are meaningless for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.52,0:10:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.97,0:10:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was anything even I could find meaningful,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be this moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.22,0:10:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if a man who went to his death in obscurity
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,could have such a thing as a wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.73,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassin...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.69,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.73,0:11:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just too gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.78,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.53,0:11:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn your place, mongrel.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You will spoil the festivities.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.04,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see it is finally time.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.54,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that is?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are wishes being drawn up by the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.04,0:12:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The true nature of you mongrels.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.46,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The malevolence of humanity.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.39,0:12:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To be able to grant any and all wishes
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.93,0:12:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,means to effect material change upon the world
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.46,0:12:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond the limits of what can be achieved by any living thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.47,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Humanity cannot grant its own wishes, for you are inherently limited beings.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.94,0:12:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether they are for equality, peace, or happiness,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.46,0:12:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,those wishes will never be fulfilled by you, prisoners of your flesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.04,0:12:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why you humans constructed that Holy Grail—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.55,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,not to be set free from all suffering
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.74,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather to overcome it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.69,0:13:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the end result of that ideal is as you see.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.41,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing holds more power to change the world than the malevolent desires of humanity.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.46,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, fueled by malevolence, your cup of salvation can only bring about self-annihilation.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold your true nature.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.04,0:13:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness the shape an omnipotent wish-granter takes in this age.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.88,0:13:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be far larger in scope than ten years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.46,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The curses will stream forth without end.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.71,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do, boy?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.20,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.55,0:13:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This will provide me some sport.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.75,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.67,0:14:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, time to get out of this awful place.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.29,0:14:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a useless core, but you don't want to let him go?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess anyone would be upset at having their heart yanked out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Down we go, Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.87,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To be king is so constrictive.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.84,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The instant I take a mongrel like you seriously, \Nthat is defeat in my eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.00,0:14:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence, you may rejoice.{YUENI}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.03,0:14:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall not go all-out against you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.43,0:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,on!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.23,0:15:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace on!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your quality seems to be slipping.{aniplex in one sentence}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.65,0:15:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your tongue the only thing of substance about you, faker?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to defeat him.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Archer...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.97,0:15:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good enough to fend off his Noble Phantasms.{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.39,0:15:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.85,0:15:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My only hope is to neutralize the Noble Phantasms he fires by firing back the exact same items.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.69,0:15:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.46,0:15:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll copy them all.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.25,0:15:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...on!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.07,0:16:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Possession experience, assimilation complete!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.71,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Production complete! All projections, stand by!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.96,0:16:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're producing several this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.12,0:16:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You have duplicated all of my \NNoble Phantasms in your field of view.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us score your efforts.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, no matter how faithful the reproductions,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.66,0:16:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I shan't allow a single one to remain.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Release freeze...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.60,0:16:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All projections, successive fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.61,0:16:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite durable, for glasswork.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.60,0:16:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't copy faster, you'll be cut to pieces.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.91,0:16:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace on!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What an utterly foolish notion.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.70,0:17:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right to target the Holy Grail \Nunder the assumption that you cannot beat me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.69,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that is your thinking, simply killing that man would be better.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to stop the Holy Grail,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the most effective way is to eliminate Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.71,0:17:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To try to save him nonetheless is hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,An act which sums up you mongrels perfectly.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.18,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.93,0:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lost its core and now desires me as its replacement?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.81,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.13,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get a read on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.74,0:18:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even get a read on its structure!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Exterminate it,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.26,0:18:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ea.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was holding back.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.36,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But at this rate, sparing Archer would have afforded me more amusement,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.57,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.27,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That shockwave just now...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.18,0:19:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our positions...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.14,0:19:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassin, are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I disengage from this man, he will use it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.39,0:19:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,His sword technique...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.55,0:19:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it wise to pull your blows?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.71,0:19:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you persist, I could force you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.81,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you deliberately entered my range?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.31,0:19:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to force an end to our contest, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.29,0:19:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When in a duel, do not let your mind wander to what comes after.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I try to put some distance between us,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.81,0:19:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will play right into his hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you hesitate?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.63,0:19:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I guard this gate, you guard something of your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.16,0:19:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So there should be no room for doubt.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Saber...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not the only one running out of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.90,0:20:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have done you a discourtesy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.54,0:20:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As you say, we are both out of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.34,0:20:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret technique:
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow Reversal! {sparrow}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.17,0:20:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd thought her to be a lovely little bird,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.92,0:21:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems she was closer to a lioness.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.49,0:21:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think I considered myself a fair judge of women.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.27,0:21:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose my training in that art is equally wanting.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.89,0:23:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the supreme ruler may wield that blade.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.12,0:23:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Can being summoned incorrectly change a Servant so drastically?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.69,0:23:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't get there in time, do what has to be done.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.85,0:23:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, King of Heroes.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.77,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have enough weapons in stock?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:16.75,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:24.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:27.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:31.18,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:36.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:43.05,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:47.55,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:50.22,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.99,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:03:01.36,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:06.61,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:10.43,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}The tip of the blade held high
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:12.93,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}And all the feelings held inside
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:20.38,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
