Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.11,0:22:14.24,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H96B9F7&\t(3066,0,1,\c&H000000&)\blur0.75}Então quero cantar sobre felicidade e desespero
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.26,0:22:26.00,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,376,1,\c&H96B9F7&\3c&H0E1425&)\t(4964,6006,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)\t(6006,6423,\c&H6D5188&\3c&H0E1425&)\t(10678,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Enquanto ainda posso
