Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.67,0:22:38.73,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,400,1,\c&H632355&\3c&H120405&)\blur0.75}É lutar a um passo da morte
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.73,0:22:47.01,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H632355&\3c&H120405&\t(2015,3016,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)\t(3048,3048,1,\c&HFEFBE5&\3c&H1A0602&)\blur0.75}Com sonhos em nossos corações
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.02,0:22:51.23,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\fad(0,200)}Certa vez você chorou na noite
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.23,0:22:59.44,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}Mas um futuro melhor sempre foi possível para nós
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.44,0:23:04.01,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}A quietude espera por você
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.01,0:23:10.29,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,0)}Podemos encontrar aquela colina resplandecente
